  "description": "IPG is a comprehensive ASP.NET Core 8.0 library providing standardized implementations for logging (Serilog + Application Insights), multiple database support (MySQL, PostgreSQL, Supabase), background jobs (Hangfire), cloud storage (Azure Blob, Supabase, GCS), email/SMS services, PDF generation (QuestPDF), Firebase (Auth + FCM), CORS security, JWT authentication, and more - helping you build production-ready APIs 10x faster.",
